      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Chronic headache is an independent clinical picture. Headaches are to be interpreted as a warning sign from the body until this is excluded through differential diagnostics. The clarification and the initial treatment should be carried out by a neurologist to ensure sufficient diagnostic certainty."},
